      <p>In the earlier example, NIC1 on all control plane and worker nodes connects to the non-routable network (<code>provisioning</code>) that is only used for the installation of the OpenShift Container Platform cluster. NIC2 on all control plane and worker nodes connects to the <code>baremetal</code> network.</p>
